# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WORKER_BINDING
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare D1/KV/other bindings are declared in the runtime deployment
# configuration and accessed server-side. They are deliberately not represented
# as browser-visible NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
#
# Production bindings:
#   D1: raksha-kali-mandir-db
#   KV cache: raksha-kali-mandir-cache
#   KV session: mandir-session-store
#   Turnstile: maarakshakali-portal
#
# Do not put credentials or binding secrets in this section.
